<title>NETHERLANDS: Kempen sees Goudsmit outperforming.</title>
<headline>Kempen sees Goudsmit outperforming.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Oct 2 research note.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Goudsmit	  training	115.60  Kempen &amp; Co</p>
<p>			  flex employment</p>
<p>COMMENT: Outperformer. Very favourable earnings outlook.</p>
<p>Goudsmit aims to double its turnover within three to five years.</p>
<p>Took right decision to concentrate on flexible employment and training as core activities. These are high-margin businesses with strong growth potential. 12-month price target 150 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):     EPS    pvs	 P/E    Dividend</p>
